# Python Projects

This repository contains small Python programs and applications I developed while learning Python. The projects helped me practice programming fundamentals through hands-on coding.

## Topics Covered

- Variables, conditions and loops
- Functions and basic program logic
- Calculations and conversions
- Games and quizzes
- Basic application development
- GUI programming with PyQt5

## Projects

### Beginner Python Programs

Contains small applications such as calculators, games, a banking system, a shopping cart and a digital clock.

## Technologies

- Python
- PyQt5 (for the digital clock application)

## About

This repository documents my progress as I learn Python and apply programming concepts through practical exercises. Some programs were developed by following tutorials, which I use as a learning resource.
